  <title><![CDATA[Visa’s Stablecoin Platform launches with Open USD, sending Circle down 6% 😳🪙; Ramp’s free LLM Router isn’t the product 🤖📊; Nubank just bought a $6.3M bank to keep calling itself one 🤑🏦]]></title>
