  <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Hey Everyone,</p><p><span>Good morning &amp; happy Wednesday! Today, we&#8217;re diving into finance giant </span><strong><span>Visa</span></strong><span>, which </span><strong><span>just launched the Visa Stablecoin Platform to rival Circle</span></strong><span> (why Visa followed the </span>same pattern Anthropic set with <a href="https://linas.substack.com/p/claude-managed-agents-update">Claude Managed Agents</a><span>, &amp; what&#8217;s the bigger play here + bonus deep dives into </span><a href="https://linas.substack.com/p/fintechpulse1098"><span>Coinbase</span></a><span>, </span><a href="https://linas.substack.com/p/fintechpulse1078"><span>Circle</span></a><span>, and the </span><a href="https://linas.substack.com/p/stablesresources"><span>Ultimate List of Stables Resources</span></a><span> inside), spend managemet giant </span><strong><span>Ramp</span></strong><span> that just unveiled </span><strong><span>Free LLM Router, which isn&#8217;t even the product</span></strong><span> (why the fintech giant </span>started giving away free AI infrastructure &amp; how it perfectly captures <a href="https://linas.substack.com/p/how-to-build-an-ai-monopoly">the AI Monopoly strategy</a> + bonus guide to <a href="https://linas.substack.com/p/claude-fable-5-agentic-os-guide">building Agentic OS with Claude Fable 5</a> inside), and <strong>Nubank</strong>, which can now call itself a <strong>bank in Brazil</strong> (why NU spent pocket change for yet another licence in LatAm, why it&#8217;s important for their long-term strategy + bonus <a href="https://linas.substack.com/p/fintechpulse1102">deep dive into FinTech funding trends from H1 2026</a> inside)<span>. So let&#8217;s jump straight into the</span><strong> </strong><em>finnovative </em><span>stuff</span><em> &#127798;&#65039;</em></p><h2>Visa&#8217;s Stablecoin Platform launches with Open USD, sending Circle down 6% &#128563;&#129689;</h2><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uiNJ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uiNJ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uiNJ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uiNJ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uiNJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uiNJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png" width="1456" height="815" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:815,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:20671133,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://linas.substack.com/i/208014671?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uiNJ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uiNJ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uiNJ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uiNJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F418592cb-326e-41e6-82cd-1c11f3f347d4_6400x3581.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg role="img" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><title></title><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><strong>The news &#128478;&#65039;</strong> Last week, finance giant <strong>Visa <span class="cashtag-wrap" data-attrs="{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$V&quot;}" data-component-name="CashtagToDOM"></span> </strong>did what Visa does best: <strong>turned complex infrastructure into a managed service</strong>. It&#8217;s the same pattern <a href="https://linas.substack.com/p/anthropic-claude-2026-every-launch-guide">Anthropic</a> set with <a href="https://linas.substack.com/p/claude-managed-agents-update">Claude Managed Agents</a>: own the operational complexity, let your clients skip the buildout. <em>Smart play</em> &#128079;</p><p>The new <em><strong>Visa Stablecoin Platform</strong></em> now lets banks and fintechs mint, move, and manage stablecoins through Visa&#8217;s existing rails, starting with <strong><a href="https://linas.substack.com/p/fintechpulse1096">Open USD</a></strong>, the token backed by a 140-member consortium including BlackRock, Stripe, and Coinbase.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QYtI!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QYtI!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QYtI!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QYtI!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QYtI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QYtI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png" width="1456" height="667" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:667,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:845959,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://linas.substack.com/i/208014671?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QYtI!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QYtI!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QYtI!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QYtI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2358e80e-f3dc-4a48-b7ae-e5be7c5a2aae_6000x2750.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg role="img" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><title></title><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Circle&#8217;s stock dropped 6% the same day, <a href="https://linas.substack.com/p/fintechpulse1098">Coinbase</a> fell 4.5%, while Visa rose 2%. And those moves tell you exactly what the market already grasps: <mark data-color="#ffff00" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Visa isn&#8217;t just simply entering crypto (again). It&#8217;s restructuring who captures value in the $310 billion stables economy</mark>.</p><p>Let&#8217;s take a closer look at this, understand why it matters, and see what&#8217;s next.</p>
